","value":"51"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Azusa represents the Sagittarius. Although he is a newcomer to the archery club, he has met Tsukiko before and inspired her to become better at it. He is cocky, confident of himself and he declares himself as a natural genius. Azusa often flirts with Tsukiko and his actions annoy Ryunosuke a lot. He is a first year."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He is in fact insecure of his abilities as he can't put his heart into anything."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c4798"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/230d28a7a9a269ec9923a6b0d4beba4149a12d26e7a97428ddf731fbc2345e1d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b220ad60faa7b6c661a23721beeb7b7bf39c11ce54fad100ff5dd71693649238.webp","width":154,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"福山 潤","creatorId":"vndb:s393","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s393","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s393","name":"福山潤","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:40265","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c4802","characterName":"天羽 翼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c4802"},"originalCharacterName":"天羽 翼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"203"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"185"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"61"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tsubasa represents the Aquarius. He's the moodmaker of the group. He 